Subject: [PATCH 267/297] Meridian: !bangs in the command bar
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"!yt lofi", "lofi !yt" or "!yt" alone open that site's search (or the
site), from the same site table as "youtube ⇥ lofi": !g !yt !w !gh !maps
!r !a !x !figma !pin and every site word.

